                                "sense_id": "ec35250e-8453-3f1f-a562-6e8c7868a2d4",
                                "text": "2. Sebesten sylvestris. The wilde Sebesten.\nThe wild Sebesten is in all things like the other, but that it groweth lower, more like unto a hedge bush, and with lesser and thinner leaves; the flowers and fruit are alike but lesse."
                            }
